          "key": "roll-option",
          "option": "target:condition:off-guard",
          "toggleable": true,
          "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.TOTMToggle.OffGuard"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "text": "Cutthroats, killers, thieves, and toughs prey upon the vulnerable of society. Directing their activities and keeping them in line are the duties of the gang leader.\n\n---\n\nVillains pursue selfish and cruel goals, trampling over anyone foolish or purehearted enough to stand in their way.",
  "blurb": "Male human gang leader"
